{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 16, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(f, g) = f & g\n  ucas: find it 10\n  note: f has no type: inferred int from the integer operations in the body\n  note: g has no type: inferred int from the integer operations in the body\nfind it: 1024 points (sampled; matches verified on the whole domain), computing in int, costs from gt1030\n  cost 1   f & g                                    exact (proved by SAT)\n  cost 1   f & (f & g)                              exact (proved by SAT)\n  cost 1   f & (g & (f | 1))                        exact (proved by SAT)\n  cost 2   f & (g | -1 - f)                         exact (proved by SAT)\n  cost 3   f - (f - (f & g))                        exact (proved by SAT)\n  cost 3   (f | g) - (f xor g)                      exact (proved by SAT)\n  cost 3   f & -1 - (f xor g)                       exact (proved by SAT)\n  [searched every term up to cost 3: 16384 distinct columns, bank full; 'more' continues]\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 16, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "equivalence of f and g", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(f, g) = f & g", "find it 10"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "find", "points": 1024, "sampled": true, "type": "int", "model": "gt1030", "peephole": [], "implementations": [{"cost": 1, "expr": "f & g", "why": "exact", "verified": true, "exhaustive": false, "proof": "sat"}, {"cost": 1, "expr": "f & (f & g)", "why": "exact", "verified": true, "exhaustive": false, "proof": "sat"}, {"cost": 1, "expr": "f & (g & (f | 1))", "why": "exact", "verified": true, "exhaustive": false, "proof": "sat"}, {"cost": 2, "expr": "f & (g | -1 - f)", "why": "exact", "verified": true, "exhaustive": false, "proof": "sat"}, {"cost": 3, "expr": "f - (f - (f & g))", "why": "exact", "verified": true, "exhaustive": false, "proof": "sat"}, {"cost": 3, "expr": "(f | g) - (f xor g)", "why": "exact", "verified": true, "exhaustive": false, "proof": "sat"}, {"cost": 3, "expr": "f & -1 - (f xor g)", "why": "exact", "verified": true, "exhaustive": false, "proof": "sat"}]}]}, "notes": [{"kind": "default", "text": "\"equivalence\" is not a word I know: the default, equivalent (args.defaults)"}, {"kind": "default", "text": "\"and\"/\"or\" between numbers: the default, bitwise (& and |) (args.defaults)"}, {"kind": "default", "text": "f has no type: inferred int from the integer operations in the body"}, {"kind": "default", "text": "g has no type: inferred int from the integer operations in the body"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(f, g) = f & g\n  ucas: find it 10\n  note: f has no type: inferred int from the integer operations in the body\n  note: g has no type: inferred int from the integer operations in the body\nfind it: 1024 points (sampled; matches verified on the whole domain), computing in int, costs from gt1030\n  cost 1   f & g                                    exact (proved by SAT)\n  cost 1   f & (f & g)                              exact (proved by SAT)\n  cost 1   f & (g & (f | 1))                        exact (proved by SAT)\n  cost 2   f & (g | -1 - f)                         exact (proved by SAT)\n  cost 3   f - (f - (f & g))                        exact (proved by SAT)\n  cost 3   (f | g) - (f xor g)                      exact (proved by SAT)\n  cost 3   f & -1 - (f xor g)                       exact (proved by SAT)\n  [searched every term up to cost 3: 16384 distinct columns, bank full; 'more' continues]\n"}, "isError": false}}
